'''Hyppoh '''(カーバチャン, ''Kābachan'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Hippoe]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

