==Enemy==
Hyppoh can be a tough enemy to defeat if fought as early as possible, as you won't be able to spam meatshields fast enough to stall her, nor will have any ranged attackers besides [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]]. Once you have [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and all [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]s, however, she becomes a glorified [[Hippoe]].

==Strategy==
In [[Norway (Into the Future)|Norway]], Hyppoh doesn't spawn until the enemy base reaches 90% HP, so try to stall for a full wallet and stack Gross Cats and Lizard Cats before facing her. You need to stall her with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] until you can get strong hitters like Valkyrie Cat or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], or whittle her down with the aforementioned Gross Cat and Lizard Cat stack.

Keep in mind that she outranges [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] and [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]], so don't rely on them as your main offense against Hyppoh.

For later encounters: do not expect her to be a main threat, so focus your army on other things and this will just get taken out in the process.

