==Trivia==
*Hyppoh's name may be derived from ''hyper'' (referencing her increased speed and strength compared to [[Hippoe]]) and ''hippo''.
*Hyppoh's Japanese name, Kābachan (カーバチャン), is nearly the same as Hippoe's (カバちゃん), but the "chan" is written in katakana instead of hiragana and a ー (''[[wikipedia:Chōonpu|chōonpu]]'') is added after the "ka".
**''Kaba'' is Japanese for hippo. Kaba-chan is the name of a [[wikipedia:Kaba-chan|transgender actress and choreographer]].
*She provided the information in [[Bun Bun Symbiote]]'s Japanese description, though it shouldn't be taken at face value according to her own Japanese description.
*Since she's described as a liar in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], the extra tongues shown in her attack animation may be a visual pun on the idiom "speak with a forked tongue", meaning "to speak deceptively".
*Her spritesheet contains a few unused sprites for a green slime effect, presumably meant as part of her attack animation. This slime effect also appears in [[Imperator Sael]]'s spritesheet.

